<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">You should carefully read this prospectus and the information below
under the caption &ldquo;Where You Can Find More Information&rdquo; before making an investment decision. You should rely only on the
information contained in this prospectus. We have not authorized anyone to provide you with information other than the information that
we have provided in this prospectus and your reliance on any unauthorized information or representation is at your own risk. This prospectus
is not an offer to sell these securities, and it is not soliciting an offer to buy these securities, in any jurisdiction where the offer
or sale is not permitted. You should assume that the information appearing in this prospectus is accurate only as of the date of this
prospectus. Our business, financial condition, results of operations, and prospects may have changed since those dates. References in
this prospectus to the terms, unless the context indicates otherwise, &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; &ldquo;our,&rdquo; &ldquo;the
Company,&rdquo; &ldquo;SG DevCo&rdquo; and &ldquo;our business&rdquo; refer to Safe and Green Development Corporation.</P>

