<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><B>Results of Operations
for the Year Ended December 31, 2022 and Period Ended December 31, 2021</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The discussion of the operations for the year
ended December 31, 2022 includes our operations for the year; however, the discussion of the operations for the period ended December
31, 2021 only includes operations from February 17, 2021 through December 31, 2021. Accordingly, the results of operations reported for
the year ended December 31, 2022 and the period ended December 31, 2021 are not comparable.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

